VoiceInk's transcription, transcript-cleanup policy, selection editing workflow,
bounded history context, retry and guarded delivery behavior originate in
SiriRemoteForge's Voice functionality by Wenqian Zhang. They have been adapted
into a separate cross-platform Rust/Tauri application.

Dependencies are listed and version-locked in package-lock.json and
src-tauri/Cargo.lock. Their copyright and license notices are collected in
src-tauri/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt by scripts/collect-notices.mjs before packaging.
No BlackHole driver, Siri Remote router, private Apple framework, or Thinking
Orbs library is included in this independent application.
